(148, 'Water', 'Technique', '💮', 'Characters in the body of water the Kami is manifesting from must pass a TN 4 (Earth 2, Fire 5) [Fitness] Check or be pulled into the Kami and begin suffocating (Pg. 269 of Core Rulebook). To escape afterward they must succeed a TN 3 (Earth 1, Fire 4) [Fitness] Check using an action.'),
