(154, 'Air', 'Technique', '💮', 'Learn their demeanor if the creator is an NPC.'),
(155, 'Air', 'Technique', '💮', 'Choose an [Advantage] or [Disadvantage] to fake. The character believes you have it simply by observing you, and does not think you know you gave this away intentionally. If you do an act that contradicts this "fact" then any character can pass a TN 5 (Earth 6, Fire 3) [Sentiment] check to realize you don''t have the quality. This lasts until the target succeeds on one of these checks or find concrete contrary evidence.'),
