(267, 'Earth', 'Technique', '💮', 'Reduce the TN of [Reinforce] actions by 1 while occupying the [Fortification] in a [Mass Battle].'),
(267, 'Earth', 'Technique', '💮💮+', E'Add a [Terrain] quality to the area at 1-3 range around the area. Choose from: [Dangerous], [Entangling], [Obscuring], or [Recessed].\n\n[Mass Battle]: Cohorts attacking a cohort in the [Fortification] count as being in that terrain.'),
(268, 'Earth', 'Technique', '💮+', '[Guard]: Select any target characters with [Focus] not higher than your [Performance] ranks + 2 per 💮 spent. Each receives [Strife] equal to your [Performance] ranks when they do not target you and use Attack or Scheme Actions. Lasts until end of your next turn.'),
